{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CepHPFatqqNFJuwVwJd1s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll add the count endpoint following the existing architecture. Let me first read the articles route file to understand the patterns and then the Prisma schema."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4566,"cache_read_input_tokens":21627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4566},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"870b236a-101b-44e2-a0b4-e7a53fcdfa2d","uuid":"08b91796-afa8-40aa-b592-271b5613ba2b","timestamp":"2026-09-07T15:03:47.123Z","request_id":"req_011CepHPEuDxc3VAH6cWo78i"}
